Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.13,0:00:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.70,0:00:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,克劳力在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.64,0:00:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.14,0:00:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我哥哥在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my brother?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.30,0:00:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,小卡  我可能有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, I think I might've found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.66,0:00:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上  你该担心自己的健康了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, you need to be worrying about yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.02,0:00:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.93,0:00:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.74,0:00:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要更多能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need more grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.97,0:00:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-梅塔特隆呢  -还在监狱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And Metatron? - Still in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.97,0:00:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个好士兵  汉娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a good soldier, Hannah...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.09,0:00:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你哥哥生龙活虎呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother is very much alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.27,0:00:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,多亏了血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}courtesy of the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.62,0:00:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,血印需要血祭\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark needs to be sated.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.15,0:00:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,否则我就会变成恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise, I turn into a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.51,0:00:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能接受的是  他是我的死党\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't stand that he's my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.48,0:00:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起创建完美的地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together, we create the perfect hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.44,0:00:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我会找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am going to find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.05,0:00:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我会救回我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am going to save my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,需要帮忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need some help?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.54,0:00:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的话  就不那么做  他是个禽兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't do that. He's a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.07,0:00:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.23,0:00:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你去我指定的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as you show up where I tell you to show up,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.01,0:00:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你弟弟就不会有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}your brother will be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.23,0:00:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我都叫他放我走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told him to let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.49,0:00:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他现在陷入的麻烦  就只是他的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}So whatever jam he's in now, that is his problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.61,0:00:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,(2003年6月21日)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.89,0:01:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.82,0:01:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,别啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.88,0:01:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.31,0:01:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.52,0:01:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.52,0:01:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.67,0:02:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那晚  迪恩·温彻斯特杀了我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that was the night that Dean Winchester murdered my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.33,0:02:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.05,0:02:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他必须死\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why he's gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.76,0:02:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.58,0:02:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我不需要你的同情  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not looking for your sympathy, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.31,0:02:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我要的是你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.21,0:02:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我迪恩在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, why don't you tell me where Dean-o is,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.61,0:02:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我就放你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I'll let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.21,0:02:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.24,0:02:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.75,0:02:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你哥哥告诉我  我完全可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you know your brother gave me the, uh, green light
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.45,0:02:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,一枪崩了你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}to put one between your eyes, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.81,0:02:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.28,0:02:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩现在不是他自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean isn't Dean right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.38,0:02:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, look, I don't know who you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.70,0:02:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫科尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name's Cole.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.91,0:02:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,听着  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Sam...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.85,0:02:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,每天晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every night...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.28,0:02:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,自从我13岁起\N{\fnArial\fs30}since I was 13 years old...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.00,0:02:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,每天晚上  我闭上眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every night, I close my eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.43,0:03:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到的都是你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and all I can see is your brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.99,0:03:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那一地的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all that blood...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.88,0:03:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,和我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.67,0:03:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.22,0:03:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道迪恩是你的亲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know Dean's family and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.67,0:03:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,但他放弃了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he gave you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.40,0:03:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你完全没理由保护他了  完全没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have no reason to protect him... none.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.28,0:03:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,所以帮帮我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.68,0:03:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.28,0:03:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你爸爸的事  我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sorry about your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.09,0:03:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不管是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.56,0:03:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩肯定自有原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean had a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.36,0:03:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道要怎么跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how to tell you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.76,0:03:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这世界上是有怪物的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are monsters out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.29,0:03:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我不知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think I know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.76,0:03:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我两次派驻伊拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did two tours in Iraq.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.84,0:03:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,特种部队  去过达尔富尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Special ops, Darfur...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.19,0:03:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,刚果\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Congo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.71,0:03:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我见过人肉炸弹和童兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen suicide bombers and child soldiers
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.90,0:03:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,年纪小的话都说不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}so hopped up on speed that they could barely talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.34,0:03:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,却会开机关枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, but they could sure as hell shoot an A.K.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.24,0:04:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是指那种怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that kind of monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.09,0:04:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,别跟我说什么怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me about monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.22,0:04:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我见过不少了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I've met my share.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.44,0:04:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我是指吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean vampires!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.30,0:04:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了吗  狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? Werewolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.08,0:04:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,真正的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monster monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.85,0:04:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,去看我的包\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.62,0:04:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,去啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.80,0:04:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,看看  就在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a look. It's right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.46,0:04:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,看来疯子也需要喝水\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess even psychos need to hydrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.06,0:04:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那是圣水\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's holy water.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.17,0:04:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,老天爷啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.05,0:04:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm not a psycho.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.71,0:04:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我也没撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.04,0:04:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,撒谎的疯子也会这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you see, that's exactly what a psycho liar would say,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.51,0:04:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.56,0:04:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,看出我为什么为难了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See my dilemma?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.59,0:04:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.22,0:04:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只能\N{\fnArial\fs30}we are just gonna have to do this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.89,0:04:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,用另一种办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.64,0:05:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第10季第2集]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.95,0:05:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,(北达科他州  喧鸻镇)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.57,0:05:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,只能看不能碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}No touching,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.45,0:05:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这是规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}house rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.32,0:05:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.49,0:05:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊  把钱捡起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead, pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.10,0:05:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,再见吧您啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.62,0:05:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,曲子还没完呢  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Song's not over, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.58,0:05:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你该走了  混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to go, jerkwad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.91,0:05:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩在哪  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Dean, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.37,0:05:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.00,0:06:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.18,0:06:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.03,0:06:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shove it up your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.44,0:06:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.73,0:06:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.16,0:06:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,看来该更进一步了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess it's time to crank up the volume, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.10,0:06:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,就这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.46,0:07:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你真走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't you lucky, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.16,0:07:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.44,0:07:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,没事  我挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.96,0:07:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都很好  没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, everything's fine. Everything's just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.50,0:07:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  让他接吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. Put him on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.32,0:07:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,小家伙  干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big guy. How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.62,0:07:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不不  爸爸现在很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, no, no. Listen, daddy's really busy right now, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.25,0:07:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.83,0:07:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  我得挂了  待会儿打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I got to go, okay? I'm gonna have to call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.28,0:07:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,闪开  老头子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.60,0:07:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这些臭小子啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids. Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.92,0:07:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我那个年代  可是尊老爱幼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my day, we respected our elders.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.00,0:07:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不过嘛  那时候30岁以上的就是老人家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, back then, anyone over 30 was ancient.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.04,0:08:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,如今40岁的人还跟妈妈一起住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now 40-year-olds are still living with mommy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.32,0:08:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,在约会网站上撒谎  给食物拍照\N{\fnArial\fs30}lying on OkCupid, and taking pictures of their food.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.17,0:08:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你想怎么样  克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want, Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.87,0:08:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}A chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.41,0:08:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得谈谈你的脾气问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk about your... anger-management issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.46,0:08:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.51,0:08:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.63,0:08:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.66,0:08:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,汉娜  你不用...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hannah, you don't have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.05,0:08:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You... you can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.82,0:09:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你不欠我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't owe me anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.38,0:09:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.69,0:09:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,但我想留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I want to stay...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.86,0:09:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.59,0:09:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这样不对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.32,0:09:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.25,0:09:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这只是很有人性\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just...very human.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.67,0:09:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这是在夸你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.42,0:09:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.22,0:09:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你得去北达科他州  比乌拉  马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to get to Beulah, North Dakota... now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.59,0:09:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-是吗  -是的  克劳力和迪恩刚经过那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I do? - Yes. Crowley and Dean were there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.29,0:09:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得追上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to pick up their trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.50,0:09:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好  很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.31,0:09:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这个...不是很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, um...not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.41,0:09:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.34,0:09:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean's a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.39,0:09:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean's a demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.33,0:09:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.34,0:09:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,大概是因为那个血印吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark... I-I guess it...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.47,0:09:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定毁了他  我也说不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just messed him up. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.56,0:09:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说可太轻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a vast understatement.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.72,0:09:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  小卡  听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Now, Cass, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.57,0:09:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你现在状况不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're not feeling so hot,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.73,0:09:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,但这算是需要全员出动的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this is kind of an "all hands on deck" situation here, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.76,0:10:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那  我们在那边见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So... I'll meet you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.66,0:10:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.89,0:10:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你真要这么做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.77,0:10:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你不想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wanted to stay behind...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.25,0:10:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的  我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't. I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.02,0:10:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.80,0:10:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得温家兄弟把你带坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the Winchesters are a bad influence on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.73,0:10:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,萨姆和迪恩虽然有些小毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and Dean may be a bit rough around the edges,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.14,0:10:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,但他们是我认识的最好的人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they're the best men I've ever known.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.43,0:10:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,而且他们是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they're my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.34,0:10:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我永远看不腻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never get tired of looking at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.05,0:10:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那些繁星\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.66,0:11:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,两杯酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Two shots here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.31,0:11:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,给他来点高档货  插个精致的小伞什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll have something fancy, with your tiniest umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.42,0:11:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.96,0:11:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你感觉如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you been feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.71,0:11:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,焦躁\N{\fnArial\fs30}On edge?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.28,0:11:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,压抑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pent-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.72,0:11:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,欲求不满\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfulfilled?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.77,0:11:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你活像伟哥广告\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound like a viagra commercial.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.13,0:11:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是关于...小丁丁的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't about... little Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.45,0:11:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是关于血印  它改变了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about the mark. It changed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.90,0:11:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.25,0:11:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你想继续狂欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know that you want to keep the party going.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.81,0:11:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,继续享乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to have fun, fun, fun
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.98,0:11:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,直到爸爸把黑眼去掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}till daddy takes the black eyes away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.75,0:11:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fact is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.01,0:11:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在需要杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to kill now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.22,0:11:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不是想要  或者决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not want to, not choose to...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.98,0:11:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是必须\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.41,0:11:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.85,0:12:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.78,0:12:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,承认吧  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Face it, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.99,0:12:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你是瘾君子  而死亡就是你的瘾\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an addict. Death is your drug.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.73,0:12:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你余生都要沉迷于此了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're gonna spend the rest of your life chasing that dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.31,0:12:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那又如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.29,0:12:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,所以  我要帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...I'm here to facilitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.61,0:12:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你要我替你杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to kill for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.01,0:12:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你替我们杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to kill for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.43,0:12:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.65,0:12:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你最终总会爆发的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to snap eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.09,0:12:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,愤怒  嗜血  会在你体内渐渐积蓄\N{\fnArial\fs30}The anger, the bloodlust is gonna build up in you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.10,0:12:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,直到你再也无法忍受\N{\fnArial\fs30}until you can't take it anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.80,0:12:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,到那时...\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.81,0:12:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,所以问题来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the question is,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.88,0:12:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你是要杀无辜平民\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you want to spike a civilian
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.58,0:12:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,还是活该受死的人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}or someone who has it coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.31,0:12:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,比如呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like who?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.23,0:12:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,比如\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.92,0:12:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,明蒂·莫里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mindy Morris.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.85,0:12:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,慈爱的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caring mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.99,0:13:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,钟情的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}loving wife...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.56,0:13:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,也是出轨的婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}...cheating trollop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.05,0:13:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,被她丈夫莱斯特撞破奸情之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After her husband, Lester, discovered Mindy's liaison amoureuse,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.09,0:13:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,两人爆发了激烈的争吵\N{\fnArial\fs30}heated words were exchanged.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.34,0:13:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,最终  明蒂决定离婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the end, Mindy wanted a divorce...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.22,0:13:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,并要求分得一半家产\N{\fnArial\fs30}and 50% of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.63,0:13:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但莱斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Lester...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.20,0:13:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,莱斯特宁可放弃灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lester would rather give up his soul
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.24,0:13:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,也不愿拱手让出家产\N{\fnArial\fs30}than half his junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.04,0:13:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就生活在一个很物质的世界里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We live in a very materialistic world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.07,0:13:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,明蒂横竖都是死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mindy's gonna die one way or the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.24,0:13:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,何不借这个机会  满足一下兽欲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not take the job... feed the beast?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.62,0:13:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.01,0:13:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,就这一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}One-time deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.41,0:13:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,还有点别的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there's something else that I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.00,0:13:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我得跟你说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}need to share with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.33,0:14:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我得进镇去买新轮胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna have to run in to town for a new set of tires.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.23,0:14:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,得要一阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could take a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.66,0:14:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你们想先进去看看电视什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to head inside and watch tv or something,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.68,0:14:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,请随意\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're more than welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.29,0:14:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,冰箱里有些剩的三豆沙拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and there's leftover three-bean surprise in the fridge,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.71,0:14:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-饿了就吃吧  -你可真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- if you're hungry. - You're very kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.72,0:14:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,以前杀过人  所以要行善嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes up for me being an ax murderer and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.98,0:14:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉  开玩笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, sorry. Kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.35,0:14:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.90,0:14:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.82,0:15:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,豆子的部分明白了  但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand the three beans, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.65,0:15:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,惊喜在哪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's the surprise?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.57,0:16:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,莱斯特吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess... Lester?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.66,0:16:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我...你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.32,0:16:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.15,0:16:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这儿干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing here, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.51,0:16:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我的联络人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, my contact...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.65,0:16:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他说你要办事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he, uh... he told me that, uh, this was happening,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.11,0:16:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我想亲自过来  确保任务完成好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I just wanted to come down and make sure it gets done right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.99,0:16:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你是这方面的专家  是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. 'cause you're the expert, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.61,0:16:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,听好了  这是杀人基本规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen... and this is murder 101...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.69,0:16:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你雇凶杀妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you hire someone to kill your wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.94,0:16:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,杀手去行凶的时候绝对不要靠近案发现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't want to be around when the hit goes down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.44,0:16:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这叫不在场证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called an alibi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.98,0:16:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道那是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know what an alibi is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.31,0:17:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我有看《小律师大作为》\N{\fnArial\fs30}I watch "Franklin & Bash""
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.16,0:17:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Super.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.27,0:17:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说  你为这破事出卖了灵魂...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you sold your soul for this crap, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.44,0:17:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不是破事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.17,0:17:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.14,0:17:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,却被她毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she flushed it down the toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.03,0:17:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,莱斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Les...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.36,0:17:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我要跟你说些话  你得听好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna say something to you. I need you to really listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.28,0:17:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是个废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.55,0:17:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你老婆  她在北达科他州算8分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your lady in there... she's a North Dakota 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.61,0:17:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你也就4.5分吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a 4 1/2, max.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.91,0:17:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我真不怪她会出轨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I don't blame her for stepping out...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.10,0:17:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其是如果她发现是你先出轨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially if she found you were messing around first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.15,0:17:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不  我没有...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Oh, no. I-I wasn't...uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.84,0:17:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.46,0:17:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是有那种变态的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you just got that, uh, pervy,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.43,0:17:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,"为了能上秘书我什么都肯做"的表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'd do anything to nail my secretary" look.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.89,0:17:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不不  男人这么做不是一码事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. No. T-that... it's different when guys do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.16,0:17:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.11,0:17:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  这是科学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It's called "science""
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.94,0:17:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,男人天生不适合一夫一妻制\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men aren't built for monogamy...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.25,0:18:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,因为进化的缘故\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.31,0:18:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们天生就是要...\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're... we're... we're programmed, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.29,0:18:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,散播种子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to... to spread our seed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.64,0:18:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,听着  你个大废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said... loser, with a capital "L,"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.95,0:18:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是个烂人\N{\fnArial\fs30}rhymes with "You suck."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.81,0:18:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是恶魔呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, you're a punk-ass demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.59,0:18:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在要为我工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you work for me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.64,0:18:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,进去给我完成任务  你个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}So get in there and do your job, you freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.45,0:18:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那你呢  你要偷看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what are you gonna do? You gonna watch, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.51,0:18:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你是想这么做吗  莱斯特  看着我杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you like to do, Lester? Watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.87,0:18:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,看好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.64,0:18:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. That's the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.16,0:18:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我报了警  但警察赶来前他就跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I called 911, but he was gone before they showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.52,0:18:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那个混蛋也打了你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That dude get to you, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.52,0:19:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的  这是打猎时意外受的伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, uh, no. This is, uh, just a...hunting accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.40,0:19:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-我去  -是啊  能帮个忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Damn. - Yeah. Would you do me a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.16,0:19:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你再见到他  能打给我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you do see him again, will you give me a call?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.46,0:19:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,(莱米·凯尔米斯特)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.33,0:19:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-嗯  没问题  -谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. You bet. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.46,0:19:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.07,0:20:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你做好梦了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you have a good dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.02,0:20:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.61,0:20:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我不做梦的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh... I don't really dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.37,0:20:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么  有次我梦到我的鼻涕是火箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? One time, I dreamed that my snot was a rocket,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.51,0:20:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,而且它还发射到了空中  把星星打下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it shot into space and knocked down the stars
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.79,0:20:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,给更多火箭腾地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make room for more rockets!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.35,0:20:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,听上去是很特别的鼻涕啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds like some very special snot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.50,0:20:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  你们可以上路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you're good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.72,0:20:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.98,0:20:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你男人不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great guy you have there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.30,0:20:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.02,0:20:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那种关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}That.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.58,0:20:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那可惜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.39,0:20:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,最终\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the end of the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.29,0:20:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只得战略性地调整期望值\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have to strategically calibrate expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.87,0:21:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,通过做这64个小改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so, by making these 64 small changes...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.59,0:21:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信  我们可以将恶魔转化率提高0.03%\N{\fnArial\fs30}...I believe we can increase our demon-conversion rate by 0.03%.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.72,0:21:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.16,0:21:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-长官  -杀了我得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir? - Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.51,0:21:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是萨姆·温彻斯特  长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh... it's Sam Winchester, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.44,0:21:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他就在附近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's close.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.16,0:21:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.88,0:21:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.14,0:21:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.29,0:21:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他死了  你说得对  我感觉棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead, and you're right... I-I feel amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.93,0:21:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他\N{\fnArial\fs30}"He"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.39,0:21:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,莱斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Lester.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.19,0:21:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,客户  你杀了客户\N{\fnArial\fs30}The client? You killed the client?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.43,0:21:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么关系  他就一混蛋  现在他是死混蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it matter? He was a douche. Now he's a dead douche.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.72,0:21:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,当然有关系了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it matters!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.89,0:21:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,交易是杀掉妻子换灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The deal was one dead wife for one soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.87,0:21:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,妻子没死  我得不到他的灵魂  自己算啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wife's not dead, I don't get the soul. It's math.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.19,0:21:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这不就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...there you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.82,0:21:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,别背对我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Don't turn your back on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.96,0:22:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么好笑的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is something funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.67,0:22:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,没有  长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.00,0:22:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.46,0:22:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.68,0:22:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我想干什么干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, whatever I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.88,0:22:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗  我觉得你根本不知道自己想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Because I think you don't know what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.55,0:22:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,说说看  迪恩  你算什么  恶魔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, Dean... what are you? A demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.70,0:22:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是  那莱斯特的妻子怎么还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}If so, why isn't Lester's wife dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.33,0:22:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不忍心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you feel sorry for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.35,0:22:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那或许你是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maybe you're human.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.29,0:22:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,只是你有双漂亮的黑眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except you have those pretty black peepers
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.33,0:22:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,而且你在跟我合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're working alongside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.27,0:22:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你能不能帮大家个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you do us all a great big favor
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.86,0:22:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,选一边吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and pick a bloody side?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.96,0:22:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,否则呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.81,0:23:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.19,0:23:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,出招啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make a move.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.45,0:23:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,看看会是什么结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}See how it ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.83,0:23:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是你的死党  也不会听你指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't your friggin' bestie, and I ain't taking orders from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.85,0:23:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我想杀人了  会打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I need to kill, I'll call.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.76,0:23:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,在此之前  别来烦我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until then, stay out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.36,0:23:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.52,0:23:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.82,0:23:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,狂野的男人  只能玩玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy ones... well, they're good for a fling,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.88,0:23:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不能维持下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they're not relationship material.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.40,0:23:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你说完了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.24,0:23:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.53,0:23:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉你  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.15,0:23:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,错不在我  在你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not me. It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.02,0:24:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,还是我来开车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I should drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.80,0:24:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.01,0:24:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这样也好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.54,0:24:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你好啊  小鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, bullwinkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.39,0:24:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,想我了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You miss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.71,0:24:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-想死了  -你是来找迪恩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So much. - You're here for Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.48,0:24:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我正要把他给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to give him to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.08,0:24:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么  -那小混蛋坏我生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - The little prat's bad for business.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.41,0:24:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他...不受控制  一定是因为血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's...uncontrollable. Must be the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.83,0:24:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,总之  迪恩又成了你的问题了  永远都是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, Dean's your problem now... again, forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.58,0:24:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.13,0:24:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,首先  要谈一下我的中介费\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, there's the small matter of my finder's fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.91,0:25:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,汉娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hannah?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.62,0:25:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,她走了  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gone, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.75,0:25:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,她搭直达电梯上楼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She took the express elevator upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.85,0:25:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,去天堂了  为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}To heaven? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.98,0:25:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你好啊  美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.42,0:25:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-梅塔特隆  -我就知道你会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Metatron. - I knew you'd come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.31,0:25:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们之间炽热的火花  我感觉到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That white-hot spark between us... I felt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.10,0:25:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我是为卡西迪奥而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here about Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.91,0:26:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你施咒关闭天堂大门之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you cast the spell to close the gates of heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.38,0:26:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他的能量还有剩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}was there any of his grace left?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.95,0:26:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if there was?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.18,0:26:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,那我要拿到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.60,0:26:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这个嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.68,0:26:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,人人都有所求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody wants something.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.66,0:26:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是  你愿付出代价吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Question is, are you willing to pay for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.73,0:26:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you willing to...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.87,0:26:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,比如...放我出去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know... let me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.26,0:26:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托  别那么惊讶的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on. Don't look so shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.26,0:26:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定知道我会要求什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew what I'd ask for.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.54,0:26:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你不是做好这个准备了  也不会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you wouldn't have come here if you weren't willing to pony up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.21,0:26:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那我也很不好受\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't make it any easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.94,0:26:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.05,0:26:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.06,0:26:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我再给你点好处吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me sweeten the pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.33,0:26:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我有了充足的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have had time to...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.56,0:26:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}think.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.60,0:27:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我决定  不管地球了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've decided... screw earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.91,0:27:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我开锁  我就给你卡西迪奥的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pop that lock, I'll give you Castiel's grace
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.99,0:27:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我会去别的星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then scamper off to another planet...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.05,0:27:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至是别的星系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another galaxy, even...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.77,0:27:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你再也不会看到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you will never see me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.68,0:27:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,作为交换\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in return...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.68,0:27:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以帮小卡满血复原\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get Cass back at full power...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.59,0:27:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,强大  当权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Large and in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.56,0:27:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这才是你真正想要的  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's what you really want, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.19,0:27:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,有个大老板告诉你该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody big and strong telling you what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.00,0:27:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,可怜的小汉娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor little Hannah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.14,0:27:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你如此迫切地希望受人统治\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so desperate to be dominated.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.40,0:27:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,说话小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.62,0:27:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,就像我说的  炽热的火花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said -- white-hot spark.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.04,0:28:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们达成协议了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, do we have a deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.87,0:28:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.58,0:28:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.01,0:28:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,她在干什么你清楚得很  混蛋迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know perfectly well what she's doing, Ass-tiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.33,0:28:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须得这么做  你快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to. You are dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.35,0:28:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,她说得没错  你的确快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right. You totally are.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.62,0:28:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.71,0:28:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他说你的能量还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said your grace -- it's still out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.75,0:28:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他在说谎  他是个骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's lying. He is a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.75,0:28:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,言语也伤人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, words hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.78,0:28:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说  汉娜  你不会想这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me, Hannah. You don't want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.22,0:28:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我见识过...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have seen what --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.17,0:28:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我在绝望之下做出的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've made deals born of desperation,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.72,0:28:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,无一不以血泪告终\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they always end in blood and tears --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.33,0:28:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,毫无例外\N{\fnArial\fs30}always.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.08,0:28:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,难道我就应该让你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm supposed to let you...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.45,0:28:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  这是我的人生  也是我的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. It's my life, and it's my choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.16,0:28:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,而我不想要这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.02,0:28:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.46,0:28:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.83,0:28:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.03,0:29:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.72,0:29:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不是指你说我撒谎的部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not about the lying part.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.40,0:29:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我的确是个说谎高手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a terrific liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.30,0:29:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你的能量确实还剩一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there is some of your mojo left.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.42,0:29:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不多...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a lot...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.93,0:29:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但也够用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.06,0:29:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你只要付出一点点代价  就能拿回去...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it can be yours for the low, low price of --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.72,0:29:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己留着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.46,0:29:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你说真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.80,0:29:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经接受自己的命运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've made peace with my fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.69,0:29:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,现在谁在撒谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's the liar now?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.15,0:29:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,想到你被锁在这儿  永世不见天日\N{\fnArial\fs30}I enjoy thinking about you locked up in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.09,0:29:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我就很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}rotting until the end of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.69,0:29:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这是...让我高兴的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my...happy place.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.31,0:29:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.22,0:30:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.85,0:30:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我会出去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.58,0:30:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,也许得花上一世纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may take a century.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.21,0:30:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,也许得花上千年\N{\fnArial\fs30}May take a millennium or two,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.32,0:30:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,但这破地方休想永远锁着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this dump will not hold me forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.62,0:30:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,等我自由了...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I'm free --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.64,0:30:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,偷偷预告一下...\N{\fnArial\fs30}here's a little sneak preview --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.62,0:30:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,人人都得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}everybody dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.49,0:30:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.41,0:30:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你话太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You talk too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.04,0:30:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你本该一有机会就杀了我  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have killed me when you had the chance, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.66,0:30:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead man walking!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.12,0:30:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你听到我的话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.16,0:30:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead man walking!!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.75,0:31:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你算什么  迪恩  恶魔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, Dean? A demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.64,0:31:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,或许你是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you're a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.22,0:31:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,选一边吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick a bloody side!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.81,0:31:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiya, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.27,0:31:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,哈维  你去抽支烟吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Hey, Harv, why don't you go grab a smoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.78,0:31:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,谁让你挂彩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who winged you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.40,0:31:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你真关心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.55,0:31:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.16,0:31:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我都叫你放我走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you to let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.33,0:32:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.88,0:32:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.75,0:32:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你的...小伙伴克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}your, uh, pal Crowley...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.26,0:32:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,出卖你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sold you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.07,0:32:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,挺像他会做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.31,0:32:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.72,0:32:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你不用这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.98,0:32:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道怎么治愈恶魔  记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we know how to cure demons. You remember that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.22,0:32:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,一点拉丁文  加上大量的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little latin, lot of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.02,0:32:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我有印象\N{\fnArial\fs30}It rings a bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.19,0:32:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你就没想过吗  如果我想被治愈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever stop to think that if I wanted to be cured,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.80,0:32:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,当初就不会跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't have bailed?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.93,0:32:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是克劳力搞的鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.01,0:32:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,还真不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It really wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.75,0:32:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这不重要了  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.54,0:32:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,反正不管发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause whatever went down, whatever happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.41,0:32:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都会解决的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we will fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.28,0:32:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will we?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.10,0:32:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我可是竭尽全力\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause right now, I'm doing all I can
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.36,0:32:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,才能控制住不去用我的牙齿...\N{\fnArial\fs30}not to come over there and rip your throat out...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.95,0:32:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,撕开你的喉咙\N{\fnArial\fs30}with my teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.78,0:33:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我在给你机会  萨姆  你该抓住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm giving you a chance, Sam. You should take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.79,0:33:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我不要这机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna have to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.91,0:33:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会跟你一起走出那扇门的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm not walking out that door with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.82,0:33:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,就是不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just not.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.41,0:33:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你打算怎样  杀了我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are you gonna do? Are you gonna kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.01,0:33:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.70,0:33:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.10,0:33:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你可不知道我做过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what I've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.74,0:33:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,没准我是罪有应得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might have it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.47,0:33:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.97,0:33:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你是我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you are my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.01,0:33:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我是来带你回家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm here to take you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.05,0:33:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,"你是我哥哥  我是来带你回家的"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You're my brother, and I'm here to take you home."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.96,0:33:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你当是生活频道的电影吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what is this, a lifetime movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.96,0:33:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,还一副楚楚可怜的眼神\N{\fnArial\fs30}With your puppy-dog eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.65,0:34:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了  萨姆  我正需要这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thanks, Sammy. I needed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.37,0:34:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你真以为那玩意会管用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think those are gonna work?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.18,0:34:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,只有试试才知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's one way to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.09,0:34:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's really you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.50,0:34:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们见过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We met?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.95,0:35:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,电话里聊过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talked on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.31,0:35:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,想起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.43,0:35:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是那个要给萨姆脑袋来一枪的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the guy who's supposed to put a bullet in Sammy's brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.54,0:35:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,射偏了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.67,0:35:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我想到了更好的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I had a better idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.83,0:35:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我琢磨如果我让他逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figure if I let your bro escape,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.23,0:35:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他就会去找你  我只需要跟着他就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'd go running to you, and all I had to do was just tag along.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.75,0:35:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们终于见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now here we are, finally --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.28,0:35:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.57,0:35:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这可好  狂热粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. A groupie.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.36,0:35:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你记得我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.54,0:35:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,当然  你就是那件事的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. You're that guy from that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.02,0:35:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,纽约州奈阿克  2003年6月21日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nyack, New York, June 21, 2003.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.53,0:35:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我应该想起什么来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That supposed to ring a bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.80,0:35:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那晚你残忍地杀害了一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the night you gutted and murdered a man
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.39,0:35:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,叫做爱德华·特伦顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the name of Edward Trenton.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.46,0:35:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.20,0:35:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.48,0:35:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-"好吧"  -我不是要否认\N{\fnArial\fs30} - "Okay"? - Well, hey, I'm not saying
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.04,0:35:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我剁了你老爹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't slice and dice your old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.62,0:35:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是说他不是第一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying that he wasn't the first,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.89,0:35:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,也绝不会是最后一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he certainly wasn't the last,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.32,0:35:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我对不上号\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they all just kind of get blended up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.87,0:35:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那晚上  你杀人后  我看到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you... that night... after.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.23,0:35:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你放过了我  真是愚蠢  太愚蠢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let me live. That was dumb -- real dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.26,0:36:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我花了半生  为此刻做训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spent half my life training for this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.15,0:36:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,脑海里已经预演了成百上千次与你的对决\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've played out this fight a thousand times in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.99,0:36:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我很了解你  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know all about you, Dean-o.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.19,0:36:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你很厉害  真的很厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're good. Oh, you're real good.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.59,0:36:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不过  我更厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, you see, I'm better.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.52,0:36:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,证明啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.78,0:36:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,开枪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.13,0:36:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那可算不上报复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's not payback.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.96,0:36:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这才是\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is payback.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.29,0:36:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.29,0:36:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是说说  但也许...\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm just spitballing here, but, uh, maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.48,0:37:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你并不像你想的那么厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are not as good as you think you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.69,0:37:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你懂功夫吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know kung fu?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.80,0:37:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么都懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.96,0:37:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那就上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.16,0:37:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you think was gonna happen, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.95,0:37:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你溜达到这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just stroll up here
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.09,0:37:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么"我叫伊尼戈·蒙托亚(取自1987年电影《公主新娘》)\N{\fnArial\fs30}and say "My name is Inigo Montoya.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.09,0:37:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.67,0:37:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你杀了我父亲  受死吧"\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed my father. Prepare to die,"
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.52,0:37:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我就会老实受死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'd just roll over?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.41,0:37:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,真是...悲哀啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's just -- it makes me sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.50,0:37:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本不知道自己惹上谁了  是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea what you walked into here, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.50,0:37:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,完全不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}None.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.16,0:37:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.56,0:37:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.39,0:38:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,动手啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.16,0:38:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你说过如果你见到我  就会杀了我  那动手啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said if you saw me, you would kill me, so do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.43,0:38:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我改主意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I changed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.18,0:38:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,别动  结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.19,0:38:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,结束了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.75,0:38:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,和你做生意很愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}A pleasure doing business.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.09,0:38:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你打算怎么处理它\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.35,0:38:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,扔进火山  留在月球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toss it into a volcano, leave it on the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.02,0:38:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我会想出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get creative.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.12,0:39:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.28,0:39:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我和你一样不想让迪恩再碰到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want Dean getting his hands on the precious
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.36,0:39:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}any more than you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.87,0:39:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你哥哥知道我背叛了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother knows I ratted.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.10,0:39:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他会怀恨在心\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tends to hold a grudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.61,0:39:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不想被\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to get...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.76,0:39:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,捅了\N{\fnArial\fs30}boned.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.83,0:39:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这样我们之间也没一笔勾销\N{\fnArial\fs30}This doesn't make us square.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.23,0:39:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我再看到你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I see you again --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.10,0:39:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,得了吧  萨曼莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, stop it, Samantha.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.36,0:39:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,没人喜欢受人作弄\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one likes a tease.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.19,0:39:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,把你所有关于恶魔的书都给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me every book you have on demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.29,0:40:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.08,0:40:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,该动身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.07,0:40:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,真是脏死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing is filthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.42,0:40:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这只是辆车  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a car, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.99,0:40:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,"这只是辆车"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"It's just a...car""
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.93,0:40:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你还真是变黑暗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really have gone dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.60,0:40:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本想不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.58,0:40:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.42,0:40:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到了刚刚发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw what happened back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.68,0:40:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你本可以杀了那家伙  但你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have killed that guy, and you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.44,0:41:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你对他心生怜悯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took mercy on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.48,0:41:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你管那叫怜悯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call that mercy?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.92,0:41:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,想想你这一生都耗费在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine you spend your whole life
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.54,0:41:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,追捕杀死你父亲的人上\N{\fnArial\fs30}hunting down the guy that knifed your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.62,0:41:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,等你最终找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you finally find him...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.29,0:41:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他把你当狗一样打\N{\fnArial\fs30}He whips you like a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.55,0:41:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得那感觉如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you think that feels?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.43,0:41:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那孩子余生都会想着  他有过机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}That kid's gonna spend his whole life knowing that he had his shot
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.02,0:41:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但却无法打败我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that he couldn't beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.06,0:41:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是怜悯\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ain't mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.90,0:41:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我能对他做的最残忍的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the worst thing I could have done to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.10,0:41:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我对你  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what I'm gonna do to you, Sammy...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.03,0:41:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,也不会有怜悯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that ain't gonna be mercy, either.

